      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 4.18,
          "en": "So lets add some custom buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.18,
          "end": 6.17,
          "en": "We did this multiple times already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.17,
          "end": 8.59,
          "en": "Here I will do it again, in the UI folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.59,
          "end": 12.66,
          "en": "In the components folder, I will add a function Button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.66,
          "end": 15.94,
          "en": "a component function button, in a Button.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.94,
          "end": 19.93,
          "en": "And in this Button, we will create our own custom button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.93,
          "end": 22.29,
          "en": "As always, you can build your own button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.29,
          "end": 24.5,
          "en": "with your layout and your styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.5,
          "end": 28.51,
          "en": "Here for me, I will simply return a View,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.51,
          "end": 30.7,
          "en": "which is imported from React Native,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.7,
          "end": 33.36,
          "en": "that is wrapped around Pressable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.36,
          "end": 35.7,
          "en": "that is imported from React Native,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.7,
          "end": 38.51,
          "en": "which is wrapped around another inner View,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.51,
          "end": 41.7,
          "en": "all because of styling and layout reasons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.7,
          "end": 43.88,
          "en": "which is then wrapped around some Text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.88,
          "end": 45.93,
          "en": "which is also imported from React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.91,
          "end": 48.56,
          "en": "Now the Text should have a caption",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.56,
          "end": 51.96,
          "en": "that is received from outside through the children prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.96,
          "end": 54.06,
          "en": "So this special children prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.06,
          "end": 57.17,
          "en": "which holds the content that is set between the opening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.17,
          "end": 60.09,
          "en": "and closing text of our custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.09,
          "end": 62.71,
          "en": "And Pressable should have the onPress prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.71,
          "end": 65.71,
          "en": "and trigger a function that's also set from outside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.71,
          "end": 68.74,
          "en": "through the onPress prop that we receive here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.74,
          "end": 70.14,
          "en": "on the custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.14,
          "end": 74.25,
          "en": "So I set onPress, which we receive as a value for onPress",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.25,
          "end": 76.343,
          "en": "on the built-in Pressable component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.01,
          "end": 80.82,
          "en": "Next, we can start adding some styles here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.82,
          "end": 83.35,
          "en": "So well add my good old StyleSheet object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.35,
          "end": 86.94,
          "en": "from React Native, create my StyleSheet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.94,
          "end": 89.87,
          "en": "and then in there, as always there are plenty of styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.87,
          "end": 91.7,
          "en": "you can set and configure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.7,
          "end": 94.6,
          "en": "I will add a general button style here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.6,
          "end": 97.18,
          "en": "where I will give as a board of radius of,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.18,
          "end": 100.44,
          "en": "lets say 4 for some rounded corners,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.44,
          "end": 102.463,
          "en": "a padding in all direction of 8,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.32,
          "end": 105.363,
          "en": "then also a background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.24000000000001,
          "end": 110.12,
          "en": "And here I wanna use GlobalStyles from my Styles file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.12,
          "end": 111.68,
          "en": "which must be imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.68,
          "end": 115.28,
          "en": "And I will pick the primary500 color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.28,
          "end": 118.38,
          "en": "But I then, as a special feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.38,
          "end": 121.673,
          "en": "also wanna provide an alternative style for this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.65,
          "end": 126.38,
          "en": "You should be able to set a mode property on the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.38,
          "end": 130.3,
          "en": "and if mode is set to flat,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.3,
          "end": 133.29,
          "en": "I wanna render a button without a background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.29,
          "end": 135.83,
          "en": "So where then we just have some text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.83,
          "end": 137.303,
          "en": "almost like a link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.52,
          "end": 141.11,
          "en": "For this I'll add a flat style object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.11,
          "end": 144.97,
          "en": "where background color is set to transparent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.97,
          "end": 146.733,
          "en": "to get rid of the background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.7,
          "end": 150.87,
          "en": "And we will also style the buttonText differently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.87,
          "end": 153.603,
          "en": "on whether we are in flat mode or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.51,
          "end": 156.94,
          "en": "So we have a general buttonText style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.94,
          "end": 160.04,
          "en": "which will be applied if were not in flat mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.04,
          "end": 162.54,
          "en": "And here I wanna set the text color to white",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.54,
          "end": 164.81,
          "en": "so that we have a nice contrast",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 164.81,
          "end": 166.513,
          "en": "to this background color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.45,
          "end": 170.503,
          "en": "And I will add textAlign center here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.82,
          "end": 174.74,
          "en": "But in addition, I then also wanna add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.74,
          "end": 178.27,
          "en": "a flatText style object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.27,
          "end": 181.06,
          "en": "and in this flatText style object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.06,
          "end": 184.721,
          "en": "the text color should instead be set to color:",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 184.721,
          "end": 189.721,
          "en": "GlobalStyles.colors.primary200, a light purple color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 191.35,
          "end": 193.59,
          "en": "Last but not least, I wanna have some feedback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 193.59,
          "end": 195.39,
          "en": "If we press this button, and for this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.39,
          "end": 198.22,
          "en": "I'm going to set up a pressed style again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 198.22,
          "end": 203.22,
          "en": "where I will set the opacity to 0.75,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.23,
          "end": 206.59,
          "en": "and where I will actually also change the background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.59,
          "end": 210.43,
          "en": "to GlobalStyles.colors.primary100",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.43,
          "end": 213.643,
          "en": "which will be useful in case we are in that flat mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.61,
          "end": 217.1,
          "en": "I then also wanna add a borderRadius of 4",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 217.1,
          "end": 219.07,
          "en": "so that we have this borderRadius",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.07,
          "end": 222.563,
          "en": "even if we are applying this press style in flat mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.15,
          "end": 227.7,
          "en": "Now with all these style objects set up, we can assign them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.7,
          "end": 232.36,
          "en": "And this inner View will receive this style prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.36,
          "end": 234.93,
          "en": "where I then apply multiple styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.93,
          "end": 238.55,
          "en": "And the first style is this button style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.55,
          "end": 239.81,
          "en": "But then in addition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.81,
          "end": 243.84,
          "en": "I wanna check this mode prop, which I'm receiving here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 243.84,
          "end": 246.34,
          "en": "And I wanna check if this is equal to flat,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 246.34,
          "end": 248.41,
          "en": "if it has a value of flat,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.41,
          "end": 252.16,
          "en": "in which case I will also add the flat style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 252.16,
          "end": 254.9,
          "en": "So the button styles are always applied,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.9,
          "end": 257.4,
          "en": "but the flat styles are applied in addition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 257.4,
          "end": 259.57,
          "en": "if that mode is set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 259.57,
          "end": 263.49,
          "en": "And this flat style will override the background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 263.49,
          "end": 267.263,
          "en": "that is set by button, if we are in this flat mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 268.64,
          "end": 271.55,
          "en": "Now for the text I will do pretty much the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 271.55,
          "end": 274.12,
          "en": "I will add style, set this to an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 274.12,
          "end": 276.153,
          "en": "and always apply my buttonText.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.1,
          "end": 280.69,
          "en": "But then I check if mode is equal to flat.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 280.69,
          "end": 285.69,
          "en": "And if that's the case, I will also add my flatText here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 287.72,
          "end": 289.07,
          "en": "Now on this outer View,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 289.07,
          "end": 291.84000000000003,
          "en": "I also wanna allow some extra customization",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 291.84000000000003,
          "end": 295.65,
          "en": "from other components that might be using this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 295.65,
          "end": 298.06,
          "en": "So I will accept a style prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 298.06,
          "end": 300.62,
          "en": "which I do add to this outer View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 300.62,
          "end": 302.37,
          "en": "This doesn't have to be set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 302.37,
          "end": 305.17,
          "en": "but if you wanna apply some extra custom styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 305.17,
          "end": 308.32,
          "en": "to the button, you could apply it to this outer View",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 308.32,
          "end": 310.18,
          "en": "with help of that style prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 310.18,
          "end": 313.23,
          "en": "I'm adding this to show you how you could build a reusable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 313.23,
          "end": 316.36,
          "en": "and still pretty configurable button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 316.36,
          "end": 317.91,
          "en": "You could also add more props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 317.91,
          "end": 322.81,
          "en": "to make the individual nested elements configurable as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 322.81,
          "end": 327.37,
          "en": "But this button here will do it for our purposes here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 327.37,
          "end": 329.5,
          "en": "And with this button added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 329.5,
          "end": 331.97,
          "en": "we can now go back to ManageExpense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 332.84000000000003,
          "end": 334.803,
          "en": "and add our buttons here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 335.64,
          "end": 337.72,
          "en": "Here, I wanna add another View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 337.72,
          "end": 339.883,
          "en": "And in this View, I will add my button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 340.96,
          "end": 345.103,
          "en": "They are imported, of course, from components/UI/button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 346.34000000000003,
          "end": 350.253,
          "en": "And this first button here will say, Cancel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 351.14,
          "end": 353.96,
          "en": "And here, I wanna set the mode to flat",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 353.96,
          "end": 355.73,
          "en": "to render this in this flat mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 355.73,
          "end": 357.523,
          "en": "So without a background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 358.4,
          "end": 361.96,
          "en": "I also add onPress here, this onPress prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 361.96,
          "end": 365.42,
          "en": "And I will add a function, cancelHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 365.42,
          "end": 367.91,
          "en": "which should be triggered if this button is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 367.91,
          "end": 370.83,
          "en": "So here I then point at cancelHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 372.1,
          "end": 375.42,
          "en": "Then in addition, right next to this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 375.42,
          "end": 380.05,
          "en": "I'll add another button where I say, Confirm,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 380.05,
          "end": 383.62,
          "en": "or actually I wanna say, Add, if we are in add mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 383.62,
          "end": 386.9,
          "en": "and Update if we are in editing mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 386.9,
          "end": 390.6,
          "en": "And thereafter we can check if isEditing is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 390.6,
          "end": 395.6,
          "en": "And if it is, I will say Update, otherwise, I will say Add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 396.81,
          "end": 398.85,
          "en": "This button is not in flat mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 398.85,
          "end": 400.73,
          "en": "so I won't add this prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 400.73,
          "end": 404.32,
          "en": "But I will add the onPress prop and add a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 405.22,
          "end": 409.05,
          "en": "for confirm, for confirming this basically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 409.05,
          "end": 413.11,
          "en": "which I'll name confirmHandler, and this is the function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 413.11,
          "end": 416.88,
          "en": "at which I wanna point here when this button is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 416.88,
          "end": 418.83,
          "en": "So now we have these two extra buttons.",
          "zh": ""
